fixture tech07_cooldown_resets_on_landing
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash "Cooldown: 24 f on ground, resets on landing or wall-cling" (docs/adr/0010)
room test/step
spawn 560 544
frames 50
input
  # A ground dash off a one-tile step: it lands below within the 24-frame cooldown, which the
  # landing clears, so the second dash fires at once.
  0 R dash
  1..17 R
  18 R dash
  19..49 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 dash_cooldown=24
  mark land 1..17 event.land=1
  at land dash_cooldown=0 y=576u
  at 18 event.dash=1
end
